{"product_id":"the-girl-of-ink-and-stars","title":"THE GIRL OF INK AND STARS","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForbidden to leave her island, Isabella Riosse dreams of the faraway lands her father once mapped.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhen her closest friend disappears into the island’s Forgotten Territories, she volunteers to guide the search. As a cartographer’s daughter, she’s equipped with elaborate ink maps and knowledge of the stars, and is eager to navigate the island’s forgotten heart.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBut the world beyond the walls is a monster-filled wasteland – and beneath the dry rivers and smoking mountains, a legendary fire demon is stirring from its sleep. Soon, following her map, her heart and an ancient myth, Isabella discovers the true end of her journey: to save the island itself.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAuthor: Kiran Millwood\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eISBN: \u003cspan\u003e9781910002742\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormat: paperback \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44847525232793,"sku":"10RC9781910002742","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/27973757.jpg?v=1727194122","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-girl-of-ink-and-stars","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}